{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もいいお天気ですね～( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )ほっこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お天気がいいと、なんか嬉しくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"５月３、４と横浜にて握手会\n有難うございました( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずは、全国握手会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアは、きぃちゃんとでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアになるのも2回目だったし、\n私の2期生の推しメンもきぃちゃんなので、\nとっても楽しかったです♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなきぃちゃんは、いつも私を見つける度に、クソガキっていじってきます（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"確かに、小学生いや幼稚園児レベルのふざけた会話しかしないけど（笑）\nその相手が出来るきぃちゃんのほうがクソガキです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きぃちゃん、きいちゃんファンの皆さん\n有難う～(  ﹡ˆoˆ﹡  )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぐもぐとか、小動物とか、\n猫部とか、庭園とか、\nテナ夫くんとか、さゆレンジャーとか、\nなわとびとか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるーりまったり\nお話が出来て、楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なぜか私のまわりだけ、時間がゆっくり進むらしいです。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事や学校の疲れを、少しでも癒せたかなあ( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かくいう私も、皆さんの笑顔で元気を貰えたので、おあいこですね（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、有難う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部  ＊＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、気に入っているDHOLIC (*´ω`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝だからラフな格好で、髪もみつあみにしてみました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらみんな、「寝起きー？」とか「部屋着できたのー？」とか\nいじってきて、もお！٩(◦`ω´◦)۶ 笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部は、服はそのままで、前髪をあげてデコ出ししたよ("},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ˆ ˆ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":")\nでも、恥ずかしいから写メ撮ってない...\nそこは来てくれた人の特権っ（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3、4部  ＊＊"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGO!4での、小百合先生ですー(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社会科の授業、面白かったって\n好評で嬉しかったです ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ行ったことない庭園も、色々教えてくださって有難うございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんから教えてもらったとこ、\n行ってみますね～(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のぎ天、VTRの出演と、ちょこっと参加させて頂きましたが\n見てくださって有難う( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問にこたえるよ(ミ＾o＾ミ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  おなまえ： 牛久大仏  さん\n━━━━━━━━━━━━"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  最近の幸せ教えて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  お手紙を出しに行ったら、郵便局のお姉さんが、可愛いデザインの切手を貼ってくれたこと ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼  おなまえ： こころ  さん\n━━━━━━━━━━━━"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎  どこのブランドでよく服買うの？？教えてーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊  MAJESTIC LEGON\nmysty woman\nDHOLIC\nKastane\nPRIME PATTERN\nevelyn\nROJITA\nAuntie Rosa\nINGNI       とかです*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は、生誕祭もありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいか、れなちさん、まあや、\nおめでとう(  ﹡ˆoˆ﹡  )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日といえば..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだ言ってたバースデーケーキ、\n上手に作れたよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼  じゃーん！「  せつ 81才  」／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せつは、おばあちゃんの名前( ﹡ˆ ˆ﹡ )\nこの字はお母さんが書きました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、おばあちゃん\nお誕生日おめでとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、あと５月５日は、\nお兄ちゃんのお誕生日です（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのペアPVのモデルになった\nあの例のお兄ちゃん。（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モデルといえば、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フリーモデル陽菜ちゃんを\nみんなで応援しよう(﹡ˆoˆ﹡)！\nがんばれぇ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆヽ(｡･ω･｡)正義"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2015/05/05/0258488/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}